@startuml
title Inventory Management State Transition Diagram

state "Start" as Start
state AddGoods
state UpdatePrices
state RemoveGoods
state PlaceOrder
state GenerateInvoice
state SearchItems
state CalculateDiscountsTaxes
state GenerateReceipt
state ReplaceOrCancelReceipt
state ViewReport
state ExpiredNotification
state RecordRequest

Start --> [*] : Initial State

[*] --> Start

Start --> AddGoods : Add new goods
Start --> UpdatePrices : Update price of existing items
Start --> RemoveGoods : Remove goods
Start --> PlaceOrder : Order from supplier
Start --> SearchItems : Search for items
Start --> ViewReport : Generate report
Start --> [*] : Exit system

AddGoods --> Start : Goods added successfully
UpdatePrices --> Start : Price updated
RemoveGoods --> Start : Goods removed
PlaceOrder --> GenerateInvoice : Order placed
GenerateInvoice --> Start : Invoice generated
SearchItems --> CalculateDiscountsTaxes : Select for purchase
CalculateDiscountsTaxes --> GenerateReceipt : Purchase completed
GenerateReceipt --> ReplaceOrCancelReceipt : [Replace or cancel]
ReplaceOrCancelReceipt --> Start : Receipt processed

RemoveGoods --> ExpiredNotification : Goods expired
ExpiredNotification --> Start : Remove from inventory

SearchItems --> RecordRequest : Item unavailable
RecordRequest --> Start : Request recorded

ViewReport --> Start : Report viewed

@enduml
